{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30411","headline":"代人赠杜牧侍御 · 赵嘏","name":"代人赠杜牧侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郎作东台御史时，妾长西望歛双眉。\n一从诏下人皆羡，岂料恩衰不自知。\n高阙如天萦晓梦，华筵似水隔秋期。\n坐来情态犹无限，更向楼前舞柘枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}